azione, concetti di sviluppo software e terminologia informatica correlata.\"\n      },\n      \"ru\": {\n        \"name\": \"Программирование\",\n        \"description\": \"Глоссарий языков программирования, концепций разработки программного обеспечения и связанной ИТ-терминологии.\"\n      },\n      \"ko\": {\n        \"name\": \"프로그래밍\",\n        \"description\": \"프로그래밍 언어, 소프트웨어 개발 개념 및 IT 관련 용어를 포함한 용어집입니다.\"\n      },\n      \"pt-PT\": {\n        \"name\": \"Programação\",\n        \"description\": \"Glossário para linguagens de programação, conceitos de desenvolvimento de software e terminologia de TI relacionada.\"\n      },\n      \"pt-BR\": {\n        \"name\": \"Programação\",\n        \"description\": \"Glossário para linguagens de programação, conceitos de desenvolvimento de software e terminologia de TI relacionada.\"\n      },\n      \"tr\": {\n        \"name\": \"Programlama\",\n        \"description\": \"Programlama dilleri, yazılım geliştirme kavramları ve ilgili BT terminolojisi sözlüğü.\"\n      }\n    },\n    \"langsHash\": {\n      \"auto\": \"ae0da62b2c8e7e7b4475c8b5cf7ed40eb74f97c9b1f2d7ce98ac8fce46352e29\",\n      \"zh-CN\": \"d291b19b1526b4694e43045df8e036779aae18223bb57cdb502cb6b1fd0379d0\",\n      \"zh-TW\": \"15f05b9d223e1ce95e5826c76692632e92201d3fb769734286d280b1e263df2e\"\n    }\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"education\",\n    \"name\": \"Education\",\n    \"description\": \"教育术语库，包含教学、学习、课程等相关术语的中文翻译。\",\n    \"author\": \"immersive\",\n    \"glossary\": \"education\",\n    \"langs\": [\n      \"zh-CN\",\n      \"zh-TW\"\n    ],\n    \"i18ns\": {\n      \"zh-CN\": {\n        \"name\": \"教育\",\n        \"description\": \"教育术语库，包含教学、学习、课程等相关术语的中文翻译。\"\n      },\n      \"zh-TW\": {\n        \"name\": \"教育\",\n        \"description\": \"教育術語庫，包含教學、學習、課程等相關術語的中文翻譯。\"\n      },\n      \"en\": {\n        \"name\": \"Education\",\n        \"description\": \"Education glossary, containing Chinese translations of related terms such as teaching, le